From a6193d8f4cf15d2ad96808c0c3e21012a383c1b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dgabehar <dgabehar@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:59:15 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] vulkan: shared-memory tile path for concat of a transposed
 src1 along dim 0

The generic concat shader reads a transposed src1 with a large stride along the
fastest dst axis. Add a 32x32 tiled variant (coalesced load and store) selected
when src1 is contiguous along dim 1. Adds test_concat_transposed (correctness +
perf) to test-backend-ops.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BidfYiPxg2nUvGVowCgTPK
---
 ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan-types.h      |  1 +
 ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp          | 28 +++++++++++
 .../ggml-vulkan/vulkan-shaders/concat.comp    | 48 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../vulkan-shaders/vulkan-shaders-gen.cpp     |  4 ++
 tests/test-backend-ops.cpp                    | 42 ++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 123 insertions(+)

